    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If the notice includes a statement under subsection (2), it must be accompanied by a statement by the individual" (the if fails)

§§ `Duty to notify registrar of unconfirmed persons with significant control (s 790LC)`

-- src:10474 | (1) A company must give a notice to the registrar if—
