      `the company has not yet had confirmation as mentioned in section 790LA(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notice would be given on the company's incorporation in relation to a person included in the statement of initial significant control under section 12A` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 790LC(1) the company must give a notice to the registrar` MEANS
    `s 790C(6) both answers hold`
        `s 790B(1) this Part applies to the company` -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This Part applies to companies other than" (a JUST FALSE from s 790B(1) flows through)
