-- src:10504 | “pre-incorporation change” means a change that occurred—
-- src:10505 | (a) after the application for the registration of the company was delivered to the registrar, but
-- src:10506 | (b) before the company was incorporated;
@ref s 790LE(5) "pre-incorporation change" (src:10504-10506)
GIVEN `the day on which the application for registration of the company was delivered to the registrar` IS A DATE
      `the day on which the change occurred` IS A DATE
      `the day on which the company was incorporated` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 790LE(5) the change is a pre-incorporation change` MEANS
    IF    `the day on which the change occurred` EQUALS `the day on which the application for registration of the company was delivered to the registrar`
       OR `the day on which the change occurred` EQUALS `the day on which the company was incorporated`
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): on the same day as the delivery or the incorporation, the order of events within the day is not stated
    ELSE IF    `the day on which the change occurred` GREATER THAN `the day on which the application for registration of the company was delivered to the registrar`
           AND `the day on which the change occurred` LESS THAN `the day on which the company was incorporated`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“pre-incorporation change” means a change that occurred— (a) after the application for registration of the company was delivered to the registrar, but (b) before the company was incorporated"

